<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up fully $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up fully $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were fully $1.00 to $1.50 Higher. Demand was good on a light to moderate movement. Top $50.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  47.50-49.00 few 49.50-50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  42.00-47.50</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs.  37.50-42.00</p>
<p>Sows - up 1.00-1.50. Top $48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 45.00-47.50</p>
<p>   few over 600 lbs. 48.00-48.50</p>
</text>
